oms House "],["o","whatsit"],["p",10000],["glue",508428,67789,0,0,0,0],["glue",0,65536,0,0,0,3],["glue",0,0,0,0,0,3],["glue",394107,0,0,0,0,2],["h",25559040,545784,162005,0,"The handsome building opposite was constructed in the nineteenth century."],["p",10000],["glue",233832,0,0,0,0,2],["h",25559040,554435,162005,0,"Its facade, though blackened by decades of coal smoke, retains remarkable"],["p",150],["glue",153701,0,0,0,0,2],["h",25559040,634566,8651,0,"ornamental detail.1 "],["p",-300],["glue",1186332,338952,0,67789,0,0],["glue",0,65536,0,0,0,3],["glue",0,0,0,0,0,3],["glue",642683,0,0,0,0,2],["h",25559040,790458,227625,0,"2 Along the Breakwater "],["o","whatsit"],["p",10000],["glue",779590,67789,0,0,0,0],["glue",0,65536,0,0,0,3],["glue",0,0,0,0,0,3],["glue",159562,0,0,0,0,2],["h",25559040,563085,162005,0,"A long walk follows, rewarded by an unobstructed view across the bay. "],["glue",707789,262144,0,131072,0,0],["k",-196608,1],["rule",10223460,26214,0],["k",170394,1],["h",25559040,550502,235932,0," 1Guided tours of the interior run on Saturdays. "],["glue",-235932,0,0,0,0,0],["glue",0,7,2,0,0,0]]}},{"number":2,"pagewidth":40258437,"pageheight":52099153,"lines":[{"x":9258270,"y":9061662,"w":21626880,"h":545784,"d":161219,"text":" Local tradition holds that anyone who walks the breakwater"},{"x":9258270,"y":10011934,"w":21626880,"h":554435,"d":162005,"text":"at dusk and counts the fishing boats will always arrive at an"},{"x":9258270,"y":10962206,"w":21626880,"h":554435,"d":162005,"text":"odd number. No one has satisfactorily explained this, though"},{"x":9258270,"y":11912478,"w":21626880,"h":545784,"d":161219,"text":"many have tried. "},{"x":9258270,"y":12862750,"w":21626880,"h":545784,"d":8651,"text":"The author counted eleven. "},{"x":7292190,"y":15490874,"w":25559040,"h":785929,"d":6795,"text":"Practical Notes "},{"x":9258270,"y":17220736,"w":23592960,"h":554435,"d":158073,"text":" Opening hours The museum opens at ten and closes at five. "},{"x":9258270,"y":1